<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, it's okay. I'm right here with you."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">no... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't kill her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I know. You haven't done anything, <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'll prove it."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was at the wheel, and I was on my way to the police in her car.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, I know this is some kind of mistake. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sure this is just another phenomenon that grows out of the curse-killings. 
{PAUSE ""}
If I defend you, <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, you'll be found innocent."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> said so, but whether I was guilty or innocent didn't matter to me at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> death was a fact more unbearable than anything.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And the one who caused it was none other than me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "人物1" "11" "0" "3000" "NORMAL" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I didn't want to accept this fact.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I didn't want to accept what I'd done.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I didn't want to accept any of it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I didn't want to accept the world I lived in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">From the world I lived in―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I wanted to walk away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "黒" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
